# NOTE: Wrangler (used for local dev) reads .dev.vars, not .env
# See .dev.vars.example for local development secrets.
#
# For production, set these secrets in Cloudflare Pages dashboard:
#   Settings → Environment variables → Add variable (as Secret)
#
# Required secrets:
#   SESSION_SECRET    — random 32+ char string, e.g. from `openssl rand -hex 32`
#   SMTP_HOST         — e.g. mail.home.pl
#   SMTP_PORT         — e.g. 587
#   SMTP_USER         — SMTP account login
#   SMTP_PASS         — SMTP account password
#   SMTP_FROM         — sender address, e.g. salki@lafrentz.pl
#   RESEND_API_KEY    — Resend API key, from resend.com/api-keys
#   RESEND_FROM_EMAIL — verified sender address, e.g. salki@lafrentz.pl
#   APP_BASE_URL      — production URL, e.g. https://app.lafrentz.pl (used for links in emails)
